  'footer.risk2': 'Important: Tradvio AI is a market research and analysis platform. We are not a brokerage, financial advisor, or investment service. AI-generated analysis can be incorrect. Past performance, backtests, and simulations do not guarantee future results. All data on this platform is clearly labelled as Live, Delayed, Backtested, or Illustrative. Verify before acting on any information.',
